OL,3,AEuropean rights court orders Turkey to
OL,4,Afree imprisoned businessman
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe European Court of Human Rights
OL,7,F(ECHR) has ordered Turkey to
OL,8,Fimmediately release Osman Kavala, an
OL,9,Factivist and philanthropist who has
OL,10,Fbeen detained in prison for almost a
OL,11,Fdecade.
OL,13,FKavala was sentenced to life behind
OL,14,Fbars in 2022 for charges related to
OL,15,Fnationwide protests in 2013 and a
OL,16,Ffailed coup attempt three years later.
OL,18,FSince his initial arrest and detention
OL,19,Fin 2017, rights groups and Kavala
OL,20,Fhimself have maintained that the
OL,21,Fcharges against him are politically
OL,22,Fmotivated.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
