OL,3,AEuropean rights court orders Turkey to
OL,4,Afree imprisoned businessman
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ECHR on Tuesday ruled that his
OL,7,Fcontinued detention was unlawful and
OL,8,Fthat his rights to a fair trial,
OL,9,Ffreedom of expression and association
OL,10,Fhad been violated.
